post-it: CD-tray keeps on opening and closing
cause: Virus started from StartUp
symptoms:
	CD tray opens by itself
checks:
	yes: Windows stays up after the desktop appears
	yes: Desktop icons open
	no: CD tray stays shut
		shows: every few seconds while Windows runs
	no: StartUp holds only known programs
		shows: BIZOPP.EXE, from C:\WINDOWS
software steps:
	Install CompuFun AntiVirus from its floppy
	Scan and clean
notes:
	Broken part: OS
